WEBVTT

00:04:27.972 --> 00:04:30.057
He was four

00:04:30.099 --> 00:04:32.852
and had recently
been diagnosed with leukemia.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.813
Now ...

00:04:37.523 --> 00:04:40.693
Despite his thinning hair,

00:04:40.735 --> 00:04:46.532
despite the shunt in his chest,

00:04:46.574 --> 00:04:50.494
this boy wielded a Power Rangers sword

00:04:50.536 --> 00:04:53.331
and went after life with so much energy

00:04:53.372 --> 00:04:56.000
and an ear-to-ear grin.

00:04:57.585 --> 00:05:02.882
Now, in my years of working with kids
with critical illnesses at camp,